<title>USA: Seagull Energy pres/COO to resign.</title>
<headline>Seagull Energy pres/COO to resign.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagull Energy Corp said Monday that President and Chief Operating Officer Robert Vagt intends to resign June 30  to become president of Davidson College in Davidson, N.C.</p>
<p>Vagt will remain on Seagull's board and will be a company consultant &quot;for a protracted period,&quot; Seagull said.</p>
<p>The company said it will immediately begin a search to fill the vacancy.</p>
</text>
